{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "contentVersion": "2026.11.10.2",
  "hexagramId": 51,
  "name": "震为雷",
  "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
  "trustScope": "source-commentary-only;not-authoritative-rules-or-proven-outcomes",
  "attributions": "作者名为原稿所署，未核验独立出版版本；新补文字不署作这些作者原话",
  "groups": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "label": "卦义",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "卦辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07208",
              "text": "震：亨。震来虩虩，笑言哑哑；震惊百里，不丧匕鬯。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07208",
                "bodyParagraph": 7144
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07209",
              "text": "【白话】《震卦》象征震动的雷声：可致亨通。当惊雷震动的时候，天下万物都感到恐惧，然而君子却能安之若素，言笑如故；即使雷声震惊百里之遥，主管祭祀的人却能做到从容不迫，手中的匙和酒都未失落。大丈夫威武不能屈，所以能成就大事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07209",
                "bodyParagraph": 7145
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07210",
              "text": "《象》曰：“洊雷，震；君子以恐惧修省。”",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07210",
                "bodyParagraph": 7146
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07211",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：《震卦》的卦象是震（雷）下震（雷）上，为雷相重叠之表象，好像震动的雷声；君子应悟知恐惧惊惕，修身省过。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07211",
                "bodyParagraph": 7147
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "卦义与哲学解读",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07213",
              "text": "震卦上下皆震，重雷并作。“震来虩虩，笑言哑哑”，先惊惧而后能安然，核心是居安思危、惊而能省。《象》曰“洊雷，震；君子以恐惧修省。”此卦涉及突发事件、变动、声势、雷动，强调事前准备与事后自省，而非一味惊恐。经商需应对市场波动，工作上要临变不乱，避免轻举妄动。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07213",
                "bodyParagraph": 7149
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-1",
      "position": 1,
      "label": "初九",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07216",
              "text": "初九，震来虩虩，后笑言哑哑；吉。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07216",
                "bodyParagraph": 7152
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07217",
              "text": "【白话】初九，当惊雷震动的时候，天下万物都感到恐惧，君子亦应知恐惧而修省；当惊雷震动的时候，君子亦应言笑自若，结果是吉祥的。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07217",
                "bodyParagraph": 7153
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07218",
              "text": "《象》曰：“震来虩虩”，恐致福也；“笑言哑哑”，后有则也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07218",
                "bodyParagraph": 7154
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07219",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“当惊雷震动的时候，天下万物都感到恐惧”，表明恐惧之后从而谨慎从事，能够致福；“而君子却能安之若素，言笑如故”，说明君子懂得做人的法则。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07219",
                "bodyParagraph": 7155
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07221",
              "text": "吉。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07221",
                "bodyParagraph": 7157
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07223",
              "text": "初九爻动，变为第16卦《豫卦》（雷地豫）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07223",
                "bodyParagraph": 7159
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07225",
              "text": "初九得位为雷动之始，先因突发变化而震惊，但敬畏之后知所修省，就能转为谈笑自若。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07225",
                "bodyParagraph": 7161
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-2",
      "position": 2,
      "label": "六二",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07228",
              "text": "六二，震来，厉；亿丧贝，跻于九陵，勿逐，七日得。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07228",
                "bodyParagraph": 7164
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07229",
              "text": "【白话】六二，惊雷震动，有危难；丢失大量金钱，应当攀登到高高的九陵上边去躲避，不去追寻它，待到七天自会失而复得。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07229",
                "bodyParagraph": 7165
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07230",
              "text": "《象》曰：“震来厉”，乘刚也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07230",
                "bodyParagraph": 7166
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07231",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“惊雷震动，有危难”，六二爻凌驾于初九爻陽刚的上面，故可能出现危险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07231",
                "bodyParagraph": 7167
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07233",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07233",
                "bodyParagraph": 7169
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07235",
              "text": "六二爻动，变为第54卦《归妹卦》（雷泽归妹）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07235",
                "bodyParagraph": 7171
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07237",
              "text": "六二“震来厉，亿丧贝，跻于九陵”，显示突发危机可能损失财物；先避险、勿逐，七日得，说明不必为眼前损失贸然犯险。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07237",
                "bodyParagraph": 7173
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-3",
      "position": 3,
      "label": "六三",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07240",
              "text": "六三，震苏苏，震行无眚。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07240",
                "bodyParagraph": 7176
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07241",
              "text": "【白话】六三，雷震动时虽恐惧不安，但是因为震惧而能谨慎行事，因此不会有灾异。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07241",
                "bodyParagraph": 7177
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07242",
              "text": "《象》曰：“震苏苏”，位不当也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07242",
                "bodyParagraph": 7178
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07243",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“雷震动恐惧不安”，说明六三爻所处的位置，不中不正，不适当。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07243",
                "bodyParagraph": 7179
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07245",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07245",
                "bodyParagraph": 7181
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07247",
              "text": "六三爻动，变为第55卦《丰卦》（雷火丰）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07247",
                "bodyParagraph": 7183
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07249",
              "text": "六三“震苏苏，震行无眚”，被惊雷震得瑟缩，是位置不正且缺乏定力；但若因此警惕，谨慎行动，仍可免咎。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07249",
                "bodyParagraph": 7185
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-4",
      "position": 4,
      "label": "九四",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07252",
              "text": "九四，震遂泥。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07252",
                "bodyParagraph": 7188
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07253",
              "text": "【白话】九四，由于雷震动而坠陷泥污中，不能自拔。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07253",
                "bodyParagraph": 7189
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07254",
              "text": "《象》曰：“震遂泥”，未光也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07254",
                "bodyParagraph": 7190
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07255",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“由于雷震动而坠陷泥污中，不能自拔”，说明其志气不能发扬光大。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07255",
                "bodyParagraph": 7191
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07257",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07257",
                "bodyParagraph": 7193
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07259",
              "text": "九四爻动，变为第24卦《复卦》（地雷复）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07259",
                "bodyParagraph": 7195
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07261",
              "text": "九四“震遂泥”，雷动之力陷在淤泥，象征志气受阻、行动进退两难。最忌恐慌之后长期犹豫不决。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07261",
                "bodyParagraph": 7197
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-5",
      "position": 5,
      "label": "六五",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07264",
              "text": "六五，震往来，厉；亿无丧，有事。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07264",
                "bodyParagraph": 7200
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07265",
              "text": "【白话】六五，雷上下震动均有危难；以恐惧之心谨守中道就会万无一失，宗庙社稷也可以长盛不衰。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07265",
                "bodyParagraph": 7201
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07266",
              "text": "《象》曰：“震往来厉”，危行也；其事在中，大无丧也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07266",
                "bodyParagraph": 7202
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07267",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“雷上下震动均有危难”，但能知恐惧而谨慎行动；处事恪守中道，就不会有什么大的损失。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07267",
                "bodyParagraph": 7203
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07269",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07269",
                "bodyParagraph": 7205
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07271",
              "text": "六五爻动，变为第17卦《随卦》（泽雷随）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07271",
                "bodyParagraph": 7207
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07273",
              "text": "六五“震往来厉，亿无丧，有事”，身居要位而遭遇反复风险，只要行事持中、保护根本职责，便能保住大局。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07273",
                "bodyParagraph": 7209
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "line-6",
      "position": 6,
      "label": "上六",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "爻辞、象辞与白话",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07276",
              "text": "上六，震索索，视矍矍，征凶；震不于其躬，于其邻，无咎；婚媾有言。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07276",
                "bodyParagraph": 7212
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07277",
              "text": "【白话】上六，由于雷震动恐惧而畏缩不前，两眼旁视而不安，如果行动就会有凶险；不过，当雷震还没有到达自己身上时，就早作戒备谨慎行事，则不致受害；涉及婚配之事则将会产生言语纷争。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07277",
                "bodyParagraph": 7213
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07278",
              "text": "《象》曰：“震索索”，中未得也；虽凶无咎，畏邻戒也。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07278",
                "bodyParagraph": 7214
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            },
            {
              "id": "p-07279",
              "text": "【白话】《象辞》说：“由于雷震动恐惧而畏缩不前”，因为上六爻其位不正；虽然有凶险却不致受害，这是因为能够看见近邻的危险及时戒备，因而能防患于未然。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07279",
                "bodyParagraph": 7215
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "邵雍解（网页吉凶提要）",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07281",
              "text": "凶。该吉凶提示沿用用户所贴传统占解，仅供作为古代文献的一种理解。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07281",
                "bodyParagraph": 7217
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻变与变卦",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07283",
              "text": "上六爻动，变为第21卦《噬嗑卦》（火雷噬嗑）。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07283",
                "bodyParagraph": 7219
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "爻义与哲学解析",
          "paragraphs": [
            {
              "id": "p-07285",
              "text": "上六“震索索，视矍矍”，雷已波及近邻而未及己，提示从他人的危机中及时警戒；此时征进不利，婚姻亦易有争议。",
              "sourceRef": {
                "sourceId": "user-detailed-docx",
                "part": "word/document.xml",
                "paragraphId": "p-07285",
                "bodyParagraph": 7221
              },
              "patchIds": [],
              "contentKind": "historical-commentary;not-verified-outcome"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "excludedParagraphs": 0
}
